## ✅ Conclusion

The AI Engineering Report Generator is a **well-architected, production-aware** academic tool. It demonstrates strong use of:
- **AI prompt engineering** (structured JSON output)
- **Fault-tolerant design** (5-model fallback chain, graceful image failure)
- **PDF document generation** (custom styles, page templates, image embedding)
- **External API orchestration** (OpenRouter + Pexels + Mermaid.ink)
- **Security-conscious implementation** (key protection, filename sanitization, content filtering)

The main areas for future enhancement are: real-time concurrent user support, an actual circuit diagram renderer, and a Table of Contents feature.

